<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:03.5]<b>1</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:05]I can’t stop coughing!</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:08.5]<b>2</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:10]I’ll stop to get some honey at the supermarket.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:15]<b>3</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:17]I’m going to try to sleep for a couple of hours.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:22]<b>4</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:23.7]Why don’t you try turning your phone off?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:28]<b>5</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:30]Will you remember to get the homework for me?</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:34.9]<b>6</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:36.9]I remember having a sore throat when I was a child.</p>]]></text>
